WEBVTT

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.020
We've been expecting you, Orb Hunters.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.780
I'll protect you...

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.270
No matter where you are...

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.810
Even if it costs me my life...

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.890
I'll protect you!

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.750
Jet...

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.220
You're defective.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.080
Stop.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:34.570
Don't hurt the people I care about!

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.460
What's going on?

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.060
An awfully good-looking man just showed up!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.960
And they say he's here to see Angelique!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.160
To see Angie?

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:38.000
Forgive the intrusion.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.000
E-Excuse me...

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.500
The miracle girl?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.460
Phase 01: The Miracle Girl

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:19.730
Angelique, this gentleman has come to see you.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.500
Yes, Headmistress.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:27.990
This is Nyx, the director of our school: the Melrose Women's Academy.

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:30.900
He says he has an important matter to discuss with you.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.620
What matter would that be?

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.240
Please, don't be so nervous.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:41.060
First, allow me to tell you about my job.

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:47.750
I imagine that you're aware that Thanatos attacks have increased drastically over the past few years.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.080
Yes.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:52.590
The attacks were certainly never this frequent in the past.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:56.320
The Knights of the Silver Tree can't handle them by themselves.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:00.500
There are many who seek out aid, yet fail to find it.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:06.490
Therefore, I have decided to form an organization to wipe out the Thanatos in order to solve this problem.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.020
Is that possible?

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:14.530
It is true that there are few who possess the purification ability needed to defeat the Thanatos.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:21.000
But Nyx possesses that rare ability; he is a Purifier.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.300
A Purifier?

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:31.090
A sophisticated man who's also a Purifier?

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.120
Please do not stare at me so intently.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.450
I am not some bizarre, exotic animal.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.350
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.620
Think nothing of it.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:46.870
Yes, at the moment, I am working together with another Purifier.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:34.250
If I have the ability to defeat the Thanatos, I refuse to sit back and watch others suffer.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.150
That's admirable!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.720
My thanks.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.840
If you agree with my ethos,

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.500
then this should be quick.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:49.760
The reason I am here today is because I would like you to work alongside me as well.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.220
I'm afraid I don't understand.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.670
That's...

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:04.160
The Headmistress was kind enough to send me this edition of the school newspaper.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:07.070
There was something in it that I found very interesting.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.940
"The patient, who had fallen into a coma after being attacked by a Thanatos,

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.970
awoke the very instant Angelique squeezed his hand."

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.290
"It was like watching a miracle unfold."

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:41.250
So, I came to see you immediately.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:47.110
It was just a coincidence; he just happened to wake up when I took his hand.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:49.340
No, it wasn't a coincidence.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.570
You're a Purifier.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:56.730
No, I'm only a...

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:00.380
Your body contains great power within it.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:04.580
You simply haven't realized it yet.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:13.060
I reside in a house on the outskirts of the city of Rhys called the Sunlit Mansion.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:18.930
I will take you there so that you can help me defeat the Thanatos.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.890
Gather your things.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.290
I can't do that.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.480
Why not?

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.020
Because...

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.790
It would mean leaving school!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.910
Indeed, it would.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.720
I can't do that.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.200
I want to be a doctor.

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.630
I want to help people.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:43.960
That's why I've studied up to this point.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:48.430
Because your deceased father was a doctor?

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:54.070
I've taken the liberty of doing a little research into your past.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.010
You want to be a doctor and heal the sick.

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:01.040
I understand. It's a commendable ambition.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:10.730
But I believe that, in Arcadia's current state, you would save many more lives by defeating the Thanatos.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:17.180
Are you suggesting that, even if you have the power to save someone, you won't use it?

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.540
Forgive me, Mademoiselle.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.520
You have the power to save the world.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.250
You are a Purifier.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.250
Why did he say that?

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.500
I've never seen you before.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.360
Are you hungry?

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.670
Is it calling to me?

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.450
That's...

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:00.870
Hey.

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:03.960
Come with me to my room.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:12.490
You'll be fine; I've stemmed the bleeding.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:18.120
I've disinfected the wound, but stay out of the water for a while so it doesn't get infected.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.700
Yeah, thanks.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.370
But you're pretty good at this.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.110
I'm used to it.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:26.700
Out of curiosity, who are you?

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:29.210
I'm Lein.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.360
Lein?

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:31.800
How did you injure yourself?

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:34.540
I was wounded while fighting a Thanatos in the forest.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.940
A Thanatos?!

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.550
I took care of them.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.340
Don't worry about it.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:43.390
That means... you're a Purifier?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:46.520
Yeah, I guess I am.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:47.900
I see...

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.840
By the way, you're...

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.470
Angie, are you there?

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.280
Somebody's at the door.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.250
It's Hannah and Sally.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.640
They mustn't find you here!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:05.960
This is the girl's dorm!

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.430
You have to hide now!

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.830
Get in there!

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.970
Wait a sec, you can't force me...

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.370
Just get in!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.250
Hannah!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.000
Sally, what's wrong?

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.470
Angie?

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:25.230
I can't believe you've done it before me when you spend all your time studying!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.350
What? Sally?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:31.620
Let's just be happy that our friend's so lucky, Sally.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.140
But I can't!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:39.370
I can't believe you're actually seeing someone, Angie.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:45.030
Did you hear that?

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.730
Yeah...

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.130
R-Really? Are you sure it wasn't just your imagination?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.430
It was?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:52.580
What am I doing?

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:56.500
I hope you stay happy forever, Angie.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.310
It's annoying, but I'm rooting for you all the same.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:02.310
Wait, Hannah, Sally... it's not like that...

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:03.330
It isn't?

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:07.780
I heard you talking to a man in the Headmistress's office...

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.040
Oh, him?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.970
His name is Nyx: he's the academy's director.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.110
He asked me to help him with his work.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.120
What?

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:19.560
You mean the Nyx who lives in the Sunlit Mansion?

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.340
That's what he said.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.730
You know him?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:29.350
He's a rich landowner who lives in a mansion on the outskirts of Rhys!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.200
He's so elegant and handsome...

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.960
Handsome and <i>rich!</i>

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.450
I want him to take me to a ball!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.340
I want to ride in his magnificent carriage!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:46.130
So, what kind of work did he want you to help him with?

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.160
He seems to have the wrong idea about me.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.740
I could never do it.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.300
And then...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.370
Yes, yes...

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.160
What?

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:15.990
What's going on?

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:18.010
A Thanatos just appeared in the courtyard!

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.300
Run!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:20.370
A Thanatos?!

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:25.480
Another one?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.950
Get out of here now!

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:28.520
You too!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:31.810
Who was that?

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:34.900
Thanatos...

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.410
Let's get out of here!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.740
A female Purifier?

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:47.860
No way...

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.630
Save me!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.410
Get outta here!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:23.930
Thanks!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.470
Let's go.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.970
You're...

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.210
Angelique, please come with me.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.390
We're going to defeat the Thanatos.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:50.800
Forgive my rudeness.

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:54.350
Angie!

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.740
That was Nyx of the Sunlit Mansion, wasn't it?

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:01.290
Nyx, please let go of me!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.770
Let go of me!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:07.910
I have no powers at all.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:11.530
Why don't you find out for yourself whether you do or not?

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:15.020
Your power is invaluable.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.070
Let me go!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.890
<i>Noblesse oblige...</i>

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:29.530
If you possess power, yet fail to use it: that is a sin.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.390
That is the meaning of those words.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:36.530
Please, allow me this chance, Mademoiselle.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.300
Hey, get up!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.310
Please, get up!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.510
What are you doing?

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:53.970
Get outta here!

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.060
Hurry!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.920
Nyx!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:08.350
Are you all right, Lein?

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:15.850
You're...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.130
A Thanatos...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.360
Lein!

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.610
Let's attack from both sides.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.030
Yeah, he's a tough one!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:51.910
Lein!

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:16.480
What are you doing?

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.070
Get outta here!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:21.350
But Helen... Helen's...

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:50.070
I want to save them.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.390
If I had the power to save them...

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:59.000
If I could save them all...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.470
I want to save them.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.640
Yes, I want to save them!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.490
I want to protect everyone!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:32.340
The Thanatos is disintegrating...

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.940
The Light of the Orb?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.920
This light...

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.750
Careful!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:23.790
Hey, is she the One?

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.310
Her abilities as a Purifier far exceed our own.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:32.130
Do you still refuse to believe me, Lein?

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.130
Are you okay?

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.450
What did I...?

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:43.930
Your prayer destroyed the Thanatos.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.120
No, it was purified.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:52.060
You are the only female Purifier in Arcadia.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:56.060
You have a unique power.

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:10.070
Hannah, Sally...

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.630
Listen...

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.020
You're...

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.740
Yes, I thought as much.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.930
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.880
The legendary Aurora?

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:01.060
I smell money.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.190
At last...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:25.410
The Aurora... Proof that the Queen's Egg has appeared.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:29.380
I've been waiting for you.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.740
What is this?

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:46.110
This effervescence is the proof of your existence.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:53.090
Angelique, you are Arcadia's only hope; you are the Queen's Egg.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:59.540
The Queen's Egg?

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:38.650
I'm the Queen's Egg? No way!

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:41.680
We need you to hurry up and hatch,

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:44.630
so we've brought you every blanket we could find.

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:46.810
Next time: Under the Table.

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:48.580
Won't you warm me up?
